Plant Monitor
-------------

Pflanzenmonitor Plus can take over the plants of the custom integration
"Plant Monitor" (Olen/homeassistant-plant, https://github.com/Olen/homeassistant-plant,
GNU General Public License v3.0). To make existing automations, dashboards and
cards keep working after the move, it offers compatible behaviour: the same
status values and attributes (ok/problem, <measurement>_status, problems,
species), the same limit defaults and unique ID suffixes, and comparable
automation triggers and conditions. It also reads Plant Monitor's stored
configuration once, during the move.

No source code of Plant Monitor is included or adapted here; the behaviour was
re-implemented independently. Plant Monitor is not required and is not
affiliated with this project.
